Error [jet.InvalidPerformanceBudget]: Performance budget binary is not valid
  --> tests/ui/perf_budget_wrong_unit_direction.jet:5:16
    |
  5 |         limit: .AtLeast(2ms),
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `BinarySize` and `Absolute` cannot use `.AtLeast`
 Fix: Use `.AtMost(...)` or relative `.RegressionAtMost(...)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2903
